{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05307","headline":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得还字 · 卢怀慎","name":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得还字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"时和素秋节，宸豫紫机关。\n鹤似闻琴至，人疑宴镐还。\n旷望临平野，潺湲俯瞑湾。\n无因酬大德，空此媿崇班。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢怀慎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05307.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05307","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}